  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Maybe to stop clients udon could be used to also allow for simple in-game mods.\n Like someone want to add a clock on their left hand, or make own friend list - so they create simple udon script that is not synced with anyone and can only make local changes but can access some basic vrchat API at some limited rate. \nPeople often use clients to just get very basic stuff: better friend managing in game, better notifications, better avatar/world managing, more audio setting or more fine tuned avatar settings.\nIf such option would be accessible via udon then such people could just add whatever they want using udon, and then share such scripts to other people. And thanks to using udon it would be safe, as it would not allow anyone to steal any data.",
